  "evidence": "- TEXT_D: 1p on Income Tax ringfenced for the NHS and care; parity of esteem for mental health with waiting-time standards; cap care costs and strengthen carers’ rights; uprate benefits, scrap the bedroom tax and reverse ESA/UC cuts; extend free school meals and boost family support; build 300,000 homes a year and protect renters; end rough sleeping; defend the Human Rights Act/ECHR; tackle hate crime and advance equality for women, BAME and LGBT+ (including trans reforms); decriminalise drug possession and create a regulated cannabis market; unilaterally guarantee EU citizens’ rights and expand refugee resettlement; extensive environmental protections and clean air plan.\n- TEXT_E: ‘Strong and stable’ leadership and sovereignty-heavy Brexit (leave single market/customs union); control immigration with net migration to the tens of thousands; retain Trident and strengthen policing/counter-terror; tax cuts (raise personal allowance and higher-rate threshold; cut corporation tax) and a Great Meritocracy; allow new selective schools; social care reform including housing in means test (with £100k floor); £8bn for NHS and 10,000 more mental health professionals; crack down on tax evasion and strengthen some worker rights.",
